# AI Email Responder Agent

## What it does
Automatically reads incoming Gmail emails, generates a 
professional reply using Claude AI, and saves it as a 
Gmail Draft — ready for human review and sending.

## Workflow
Gmail Trigger → Claude API (with prompt engineering) → 
Extract Reply → Save as Gmail Draft

## Tools Used
- n8n (workflow automation)
- Anthropic Claude API (claude-sonnet-4)
- Gmail API (read + draft)

## Business Value
- Reduces email response time from hours to seconds
- Maintains professional tone consistently
- Human stays in control — reviews draft before sending
- Scalable to any email volume

## Skills Demonstrated
- Webhook and trigger-based automation
- REST API integration (Anthropic)
- Prompt engineering for professional output
- Gmail API (OAuth, read, create draft)
- Multi-node workflow design
